      "text-only visual references"
    ],
    "source_of_truth_rules": [
      "Platform content domain owns Program, Module, Activity and immutable published versions.",
      "Platform learning/evidence domains own enrollment, progress and evidence.",
      "Platform assessment domain owns attempts, rubric/score lineage and human-confirmed official authority.",
      "Analytics is derived and never grants access or rewrites canonical state.",
      "Audit history is restricted and append-only/tamper-resistant; corrections supersede."
